{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/extras/ezgif-3-a73439f6b7.gif?t=1744664720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BL0W-UP is a single-player movement shooter inspired by the best shooters of the '90s.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reimagines classic action with frantic and dynamic gameplay, along with a visually striking &quot;colorful gore&quot; aesthetic that pushes conventional boundaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/extras/Comp1_1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1_eng.gif?t=1744664720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world of vibrant visuals as you use various tools to crush your enemies efficiently and get to the end of the stage as quickly as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage will offer you additional weapons, as well as more challenges to overcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AN EXPLOSIVE REDEFINITION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 weapons with multiple synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanical depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frantic and dynamic combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorful gore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARE YOU READY TO FACE THE ULTIMATE CHALLENGE AND BECOME THE ULTIMATE AVENGER?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/extras/BL0WUP_DemoFinal.gif?t=1744664720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assume the role of M-98 B\u00e1rbara, a merciless machine with the objective of purging the Earth of the abominable alien threat plaguing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showcase your skills in annihilating the invaders, aiming for glory by achieving the highest score in each level.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A01 - 10/10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/ff742b3bf8353b8d91b49ef6640c6ea64ac63fb7.jpg"},{"name":"A01 - CHALLENGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/8f3218f7ba7d8076c32a11b6b195b4d5f31df252.jpg"},{"name":"A02 - 10/10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/580db28634bb30d035067cddb5516d5f82e9c89d.jpg"},{"name":"A02 - CHALLENGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/46f3d0b0f0c835d8e856ec96d7a8e6ffde9c9bc5.jpg"},{"name":"DEMO - END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/767ee27f8fbf0939362ddf0e7d8e836363bd5529.jpg"},{"name":"CHAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2429670/294b144cc86d1fe15c0607214169faaddb938bdf.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2429670?t=1744664720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744664720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/d0b50ee81d24fc7102dda2edb6a48d6144ca3cf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744664720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/d0b50ee81d24fc7102dda2edb6a48d6144ca3cf8/capsule_184x69.