re</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARE YOU READY TO FACE THE ULTIMATE CHALLENGE AND BECOME THE ULTIMATE AVENGER?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/extras/BL0WUP_DemoFinal.gif?t=1744664720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assume the role of M-98 B\u00e1rbara, a merciless machine with the objective of purging the Earth of the abominable alien threat plaguing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showcase your skills in annihilating the invaders, aiming for glory by achieving the highest score in each level.</p>","developers":["Half Sunk Games","Llibert_Gamedev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2301940","name":"BLOW-UP: AVENGE HUMANITY"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429670/cbc033d289df9058ab3146e4c0da5d361146d621/header.jpg?t=1744664720","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094609,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094609/movie480.mp4?t=1738679998","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094609/movie_max.mp4?t=1738679998"},"name":"STEAM UPDATE TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094609/55cf9eaf997910d609f37c7cda59d94c56a1dd01/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738679998","webm":{"480":"http://video.akama